  m_text: 'How to Play:


    Move using W, A, S, D.

    Press space to jump; press
    twice for a double jump. Holding space allows you to glide.

    Use left mouse
    click to shoot fireballs. If you shoot fireballs consecutively, your third hit
    will summon lava rocks from the ground.

    Press 1, 2, or 3 to use character
    abilities.

    Press C to view the character overview.

    Press I to open
    the inventory.

    Press E to interact with objects that can be interacted with.'
